	(text "V_HI = 3.3 × 86.5 / 100.2 = 2.849 V → +599 A; V_LO = 1.041 V → −305 A (±12 A).\nR411 1 k × C403 470 pF = 0.47 µs blanking. TLV1702 inputs rail-to-rail.\nBench (R1-11): CLR_N low ≤ 0.6 V at −40 / 25 / 85 °C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
