	)
	(text "U404 holds CLR_N low until 200 ms after +3V3 > 2.93 V\n→ latch powers up tripped. R415 from +3V3_A: lost analog rail = trip.\nC405 DNP 100 pF: fit only if false trips (never 100 nF).\nCLK: R420 1 k + C411 100 pF ≈ 67 ns/V edge (AUP1G74 ≤ 200 ns/V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245.11 168.91 0)
