		(property "Description" "TLV803S SOT-23 open-drain supervisor on +3V3, RESET wired-OR onto CLR_N: holds the latch cleared (OC_TRIP_N_PB low = tripped) from VDD 1.1 V up to 2.93 V + 200 ms and on every brown-out (VIT- 2.87-2.99 V, VOL <= 0.2 V at 0.5 mA, valid above 1.1 V; pinout 1 GND, 2 RESET, 3 VDD; TLV803 DS ZHCS187C p.3, p.5, p.8); review R1-05, replaces the P-06 RC"
